      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹4.65 (vs ₹3.24 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹4.65 (up from ₹3.24 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹257.1m (down 5.7% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹82.4m (up 44% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 32% (up from 21% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by lower expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 12% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 21% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
